Description: Tailscale with AmneziaWG support, for Asuswrt-Merlin via Entware.
 Static aarch64 build of tailscaled with the CLI embedded (ts_include_cli).
 Requires Asuswrt-Merlin 3006 or newer, an Entware installation on USB, and
 JFFS custom scripts enabled. Deliberately does NOT depend on libc (the binary
 is CGO-free and static), on kmod-tun (TUN is compiled into the firmware
 kernel), or on Entware's iptables (whose netfilter version can mismatch the
 firmware kernel -- the firmware's /usr/sbin/iptables is used instead).
 ca-certificates is only suggested: Merlin 3006 ships
 /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt, which the init script falls back to.
